BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Central PA Game Club
UID:event_315522070@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260719T042252Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260722T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260722T213000
SUMMARY:Dillsburg Game Night - Calvary Methodist Church in the Family Cent
 er
DESCRIPTION:Central PA Game Club\nDillsburg Game Night meets every Wednesd
 ay from 6:30-9:30pm for casual tabletop games. We’ve been going strong s
 ince 2016\, and most Wednesdays you’ll find about 30-40 gamers who love 
 to learn and teach new games. It’s a great group of friendly people.\n\n
 Given the timeframe\, most of the games played are light to medium Euros\,
  although many of us also love card games (including trick-taking games) a
 nd party games. We have a library of about 200 games available to play\, a
 nd people typically bring their own games as well.\n\nWe also run long gam
 e days (typically every other month\, usually a Saturday 2-9pm) and other 
 special events. Join us on Facebook or Discord for more information about 
 those.\n\nAttendees do not often RSVP on Meetup. It may show 1 person is c
 oming but we have 40 people every Wednesday and will cancel the event if i
 t is not happening. Feel free to message with questions.\n\nCost: Free\nWh
 o: All Ages (15 and under must be accompanied by an adult)\nWhen: Every We
 dnesday (6:30-9:30pm)\nWhere: Calvary Methodist Church (Dillsburg\, PA) Fa
 mily Center\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/groups/2249345335100181\nD
 iscord: https://discord.gg/sJ4sHfNEdu
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/centralpagameclub/events/315522070/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260702T224517Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260702T224517Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Central PA Game Club
UID:event_308160937@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260719T042252Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260724T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260725T001500
SUMMARY:(H.B.G.) - Harrisburg Board Gaming
DESCRIPTION:Central PA Game Club\nCome to game night in the Harrisburg are
 a! Every 2nd and 4th Friday of every month\, there will be gaming at the L
 ife Point Church. Event starts at 6:00pm in the Churches Lobby / Sitting A
 rea and goes until you're too tired to play anymore. You can come anytime 
 and leave anytime. Keep in mind you might have to wait to get into a game 
 if you come later depending on games being played. Or if you come with fam
 ily or a friend group\, a game can be provided by the event for you to pla
 y when you arrive!\n\nSome Snacks and Drinks are provided (but not guarant
 eed for each event). Feel Free to bring your own games\, food and drinks! 
 We have a kitchen available to be used with a Microwave and a Fridge for y
 our drinks. Come check us out!\n\nJon Krehling is the organizer of this ev
 ent\, so message him on meetup if you have any questions!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/centralpagameclub/events/308160937/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20250530T160244Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20250530T160244Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Central PA Game Club
UID:event_315557434@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260719T042252Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260725T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260725T200000
SUMMARY:4th Saturday Gaming - Colonial Park United Church of Christ
DESCRIPTION:Central PA Game Club\n**COVID Notice**\nIf you are fully vacci
 nated\, no mask is required. If not\, you are required by the church to we
 ar a face mask. If you're not vacced and not willing to wear a mask then p
 lease do not attend.\n\nhttp://www.centralpagameclub.com/images/entrance.j
 pg\n\nCard and board games covering a huge gamut of themes - anything from
  developing islands\, staging cruises\, casting movies\, to building railr
 oads. There are themes appealing to every audience and most games play in 
 45-90 minutes. Our friendly members are happy to teach. Many games are beg
 inner-friendly and can be taught in about 10 minutes.\n\nAdults 16 & older
 .\n\nNewcomers are welcome.\n\nVisit http://www.centralpagameclub.com for 
 more information.\n\nWhen you enter the church's parking lot\, park in the
  back\, come in through the courtyard\, and look for the door in the pictu
 re above.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/centralpagameclub/events/315557434/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260705T141000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260705T141000Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
